      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The starting material is an as-cast, coarse-grained, single-phase simple solid solution.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coarse-grained starting state has low hardness and strength.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coarse-grained starting state contains relatively few inherent obstacles to dislocation motion.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A low density of grain boundaries permits relatively unobstructed dislocation glide.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890668::web::015::3_results_and_discussion",
        "PMC5321736::web::009::nanostructural_characterization"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Relatively unobstructed dislocation glide produces low work hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Low work hardening is responsible for the low hardness and strength of the starting state.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Severe plastic deformation or a similar process can produce a refined nanostructured grain state while preserving phase homogeneity.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grain refinement increases grain-boundary density.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890668::web::015::3_results_and_discussion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing grain-boundary density impedes dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10890668::web::015::3_results_and_discussion",
        "PMC5321736::web::009::nanostructural_characterization"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dislocation obstruction at refined grain boundaries causes dislocation pile-ups.",
